,"source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest strengthens CFP case with 'statement' win at SMU","description":"No. 13 Wake Forest made a statement to the College Football Playoff selection committee with a 49-7 blowout of SMU on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-14T22:49:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50483729/wake-forest-strengthens-cfp-case-statement-win-smu","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Vols lose top receiver Matthews to knee injury vs. Texas A&M","description":"Tennessee leading receiver Mike Matthews suffered a right knee injury in the second quarter of Saturday's game at Texas A&M.","published":"2026-11-14T23:16:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50483677/vols-lose-top-receiver-matthews-knee-injury-vs-texas-am","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia commit, DL Marcellus Young Casario died after 'sudden medical emergency'","description":"Marcellus Young Casario, a Georgia football commit, died Friday after experiencing a \"sudden medical emergency,\" according to his high school.","published":"2026-11-14T20:36:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50482223/georgia-football-commit-marcellus-young-casario-dies-suddenly","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oklahoma AD rips Ole Miss, SEC; Rebels defend travel effort","description":"Oklahoma AD Roger Denny ripped the SEC and Ole Miss for the \"inexplicable\" decision to move its game to Sunday, while the Rebels defended their travel efforts.","published":"2026-11-14T23:54:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50482206/oklahoma-ad-infuriated-sec-ole-miss-sunday-game","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Clemson QB Reynolds to have MRI on knee; backup Vizzina (ankle) also hurt","description":"Clemson quarterback Tait Reynolds is having an MRI on his injured knee, and backup Christopher Vizzina was sent to the hospital to evaluate his ankle.","published":"2026-11-14T23:52:45.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50482105/clemson-qb-tait-reynolds-suffers-leg-injury-slide","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Central Oklahoma AD trolls Ole Miss amid FAA crisis-forced kickoff change","description":"The Division II school offered Ole Miss fans attending its Oklahoma matchup free admission due to the kickoff date change.","published":"2026-11-14T22:28:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481529/central-oklahoma-troll-ole-miss-faa-decsion","type":"Story","byline":"Kalan Hooks","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Ohio State WR Smith sets Big Ten record, states Heisman case","description":"Ohio State wide receiver Jeremiah Smith broke yet another record, eclipsing the Big Ten mark for career receiving yards while also making his Heisman Trophy case in Saturday's win over Northwestern.","published":"2026-11-14T23:15:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481134/ohio-state-jeremiah-smith-sets-big-ten-receiving-record","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079345/mario-craver","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mario_Craver"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Mario Craver","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mario_Craver","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:34Z","intro":"Mario Leon Craver (born January 9, 2006) is an American college football wide receiver for the Texas A&M Aggies. He previously played for the Mississippi State Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Craver attended Clay-Chalkville High School in Clay, Alabama. As a sophomore, he recorded 46 receptions for 937 yards, and 10 touchdowns. A four-star recruit, Craver committed to play college football at Mississippi State University over offers from Alabama, Auburn, and Ole Miss."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"MISSISSIPPI STATE\nIn Craver's collegiate debut against Eastern Kentucky, he hauled in a 54-yard touchdown pass. Against Texas A&M, he recorded five receptions for 42 yards and a touchdown, before exiting the game early with an injury. Craver finished his freshman season hauling in 17 receptions for 368 yards and three touchdowns. On December 9, 2024, Craver announced that he would enter the transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS A&M\nOn December 17, 2024, Craver announced that he would be committing to Texas A&M University."}]}}